# Project Rules

> See [04-react-typescript.mdc](mdc:04-react-typescript.mdc) for general React/TypeScript patterns

## Tech Stack (Non-Negotiable)

| Category | Choice | Reason |
|----------|--------|--------|
| **Router** | `wouter` | NOT react-router-dom (8x smaller) |
| **Data** | `SWR` | NOT React Query (simpler for CRUD) |
| **State** | `jotai` | Minimal: toasts + theme only |
| **i18n** | `react-i18next` | EN/FR support |
| **Styles** | CSS Modules + tokens | NO Tailwind/Material-UI |
| **Theme** | `light-dark()` + Jotai | Native CSS + localStorage |
| **Testing** | vitest + happy-dom | NOT jsdom (3x faster) |
| **Mocking** | MSW v2 | API mocking |
| **Pre-commit** | lefthook | Auto-format + lint |

## Folder Structure

```
src/
  components/      # Shared UI only
  features/        # Business logic + domain UI
  utils/           # Pure functions
  services/        # API, i18n (side effects)
  hooks/           # React hooks
  atoms/           # Jotai state (minimal!)
  types/           # TypeScript definitions
  styles/          # Global CSS (tokens, reset, base)
```

## Critical Decisions

### 1. Routing: wouter

```typescript
// Navigation
const [, setLocation] = useLocation();
setLocation('/path');

// Params
const [match, params] = useRoute('/users/:id');
if (match) console.log(params.id); // { id: "123" }

// Links
<Link href="/about">About</Link>
```

**Migration from react-router**: `<Link to>` → `<Link href>`, `useNavigate()` → `useLocation()[1]`, `useParams()` → `useRoute()[1]`

### 2. Data Fetching: SWR

```typescript
// GET
const { data, error, isLoading } = useSWR('/products', fetcher);

// POST/PUT/DELETE
const { trigger, isMutating } = useSWRMutation('/applications', postFetcher);
await trigger({ productId: 123 });
```

### 3. State: Jotai (Minimal!)

**ONLY USE FOR**: Toasts, Theme preference

**DO NOT USE FOR**: Server data (use SWR), Forms (use useState)

```typescript
// atoms/toastsAtom.ts
export const toastsAtom = atom<Toast[]>([]);

// atoms/themeAtom.ts
export const themeAtom = atomWithStorage<'light'|'dark'|'system'>('theme', 'system');
```

### 4. Forms: useForm Hook

```typescript
const { values, errors, touched, handleChange, handleBlur, handleSubmit } = useForm({
  initialValues: { email: '', phone: '' },
  validators: { email: validateEmail, phone: validatePhone },
  onSubmit: async (vals) => await save(vals),
});
```

**Validators**: `utils/validators.ts` → `validateEmail`, `validatePhone`, `validateName`, `validateRequired`, `composeValidators`

### 5. Environment Variables

```bash
VITE_CANDIDATE_NAME=Your Name  # REQUIRED (no fallback)
```

Set in Vercel: `vercel env add VITE_CANDIDATE_NAME`

